{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>Its remnant. like the gleaning of olives.</b> From the root of ונקף סבכי היער (Isaiah 10:34), and likewise חגים ינקופו (Isaiah 29:1)." "<b>Topmost.</b> It is the choicest of the olive, from the root of ויי האמירך (Deuteronomy 26:18), and likewise in the language of Kedar." "<b>Four or five.</b> Berries." "<b>In its branches.</b> Of that one which was fruit-bearing."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:54:06.391209207Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}